      "en": "As if a man fled from a lion, and a bear met him; or he went into the house and leaned his hand on the wall, and a snake bit him.",
      "ko": "마치 사람이 사자를 피하다가 곰을 만나거나 혹 집에 들어가서 손을 벽에 대었다가 뱀에게 물림 같도다",
      "source_text_hash": "e327f66c7ef733300b43a471e9cfa3407605c985ac1be78f14e3990e031abbd2",
      "translation_text_hash": "1fc552fbfd93b471afc8f6651fb37d91953cd4ddc7854c782f67d2ee7433c73a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
